From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
dcomp: animation, transform, rectangle clip and effect group objects

The version 1 device creates animations (cubic, sinusoidal, repeat and end
segments), translate/scale/rotate/skew/matrix transforms and transform
groups, rectangle clips and effect groups instead of returning E_NOTIMPL.
Visual setters validate and hold their arguments, and Commit places a
visual's content by its transform and animated offsets.
